# The repo registry is DEPLOYMENT STATE, not source: which repos this factory manages and what each
# may change. It used to be tracked here, which made policy changeable by `git checkout` (the supervisor
# reloads it live) and editable by a drydock self-run, since `factory/` is inside drydock's own pathAllowlist.
# Live copy: $DRYDOCK_CONFIG_DIR/repo-registry.json — committed shape: factory/repo-registry.example.json
factory/repo-registry.json
